        <argsstring>(void)</argsstring>
        <name>signals_setup_executing</name>
        <param>
          <type>void</type>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Set up signal handlers for executing context (parent waiting for fg child). </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>SIGINT — ignored (let signal reach the child process)</para>
<para>SIGQUIT — ignored (let signal reach the child process)</para>
<para>SIGTSTP — ignored (let signal reach the child process)</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>The parent simply waits; the child handles or dies from the signal. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
